      "sourceTextSha256": "7a8e695805d366f69ff0302c3d42cfb91d0ba0d4238d9d529ad0862de4a23b84",
      "text": "Six days exploring Colombia’s two signature cities: Bogotá and Cartagena de Indias. In Bogotá, visit La Candelaria, the Gold Museum, the Botero collection, Bolívar Square and Monserrate, and venture to the Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá. In Cartagena, discover the walled historic centre, Castillo de San Felipe de Barajas and the Rosario Islands.",
